1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,110
Woman: Customer support. How may I help you?

2
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:10,040
Man: Well, my computer keeps overheating and shutting down.

3
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:12,640
Woman: Have you checked if the fans are working properly

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,250
Dust can accumulate and block air flow.

5
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:18,030
Man: I haven't looked at that.

6
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:19,800
Woman: You can get a can of compressed air

7
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:23,080
and spray it into the vents and the fans to blow out the dust.

8
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:25,140
Man: OK I'll try that.

9
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:27,160
Woman: Hopefully that'll take care of the problem.

10
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:31,200
If not, you'll probably need to ship it to us so we can take a look.
